    "detailed_description": "<h1>GET INITIATED</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Cognition Method is a story-driven, first-person puzzle game inspired by <i>2001: A Space Odyssey</i> and <i>Solaris</i>. Discover innovative mechanics of altering gravity and dive into the surreal setting.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/ddbb6c1e272fa5d94509c732b77a4404.avif?t=1749903033\" /></div><br><br>Find your way within a mysterious artifact and unveil a non-ordinary story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Viscous, cerebral and unsettling atmosphere</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/4e60c1e19cf3b288bc71d5dd492ded22.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/4e60c1e19cf3b288bc71d5dd492ded22.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/4e60c1e19cf3b288bc71d5dd492ded22.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mind-bending puzzles and locations</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/24bbe9e7c7a48b19e2d81cad0fbe1519.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/24bbe9e7c7a48b19e2d81cad0fbe1519.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/24bbe9e7c7a48b19e2d81cad0fbe1519.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ambiguous story</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/eec5c6dcab7388318bfd1a7110b60fce.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/eec5c6dcab7388318bfd1a7110b60fce.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/eec5c6dcab7388318bfd1a7110b60fce.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Aesthetic of minimalism</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/dba9ac180f0e5ba31dede6a25ffbb360.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/dba9ac180f0e5ba31dede6a25ffbb360.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/dba9ac180f0e5ba31dede6a25ffbb360.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Cognition Method is a story-driven, first-person puzzle game inspired by <i>2001: A Space Odyssey</i> and <i>Solaris</i>. Discover innovative mechanics of altering gravity and dive into the surreal setting.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/ddbb6c1e272fa5d94509c732b77a4404.avif?t=1749903033\" /></div><br><br>Find your way within a mysterious artifact and unveil a non-ordinary story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Viscous, cerebral and unsettling atmosphere</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/4e60c1e19cf3b288bc71d5dd492ded22.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/4e60c1e19cf3b288bc71d5dd492ded22.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/4e60c1e19cf3b288bc71d5dd492ded22.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mind-bending puzzles and locations</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/24bbe9e7c7a48b19e2d81cad0fbe1519.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/24bbe9e7c7a48b19e2d81cad0fbe1519.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/24bbe9e7c7a48b19e2d81cad0fbe1519.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ambiguous story</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/eec5c6dcab7388318bfd1a7110b60fce.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/eec5c6dcab7388318bfd1a7110b60fce.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/eec5c6dcab7388318bfd1a7110b60fce.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Aesthetic of minimalism</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/dba9ac180f0e5ba31dede6a25ffbb360.poster.avif?t=1749903033\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/dba9ac180f0e5ba31dede6a25ffbb360.webm?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636620/extras/dba9ac180f0e5ba31dede6a25ffbb360.mp4?t=1749903033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
